                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7afbcdb3-b9cc-49d1-baee-c03731ec1220",
                                                "sense_id": "b1c542c7-2165-3852-a2ee-ca44750b0dfa",
                                                "text": "Henry Kissinger was there; so was Robert Komer, the CIA officer who ran the counterterrorist \"pacification\" program in 1967 and '68[…]."
